  "description": "Stop using rigid, legacy inputs. ModernTextBox.WinForms provides a hardware-accelerated, anti-aliased text input control for Windows Forms. Features rounded corners, glowing focus rings, built-in search icons, interactive password reveal toggles, and integrated floating placeholders. Fully supports Podargus Dark/Light themes and 5 premium design styles (DashboardPremium, FluentGlass, MaterialFlat, SoftNeumorphic, Cyberpunk).",
